<title>NEW ZEALAND: TENNIS-RESULTS FROM NZ'S BELLSOUTH OPEN.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS FROM NZ'S BELLSOUTH OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1997-01-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final results from the BellSouth Open tennis tournament on Saturday (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Singles: Jonas Bjorkman (Sweden) beat Jan Michael Gambill (USA) 6-4 6-0.</p>
<p>Doubles: Rick Leach (USA)/Jonathan Stark (USA) beat Dave Ekerot (Sweden)/Jeff Tarango (USA) 6-7 (4-7) 6-3 6-3.</p>
</text>
